 (56%) landed in the 7-9h target band.", "8 ejaculation event(s) logged in the last 14 days — aiming for roughly every 1-2 days (8-14 over a 14-day span) tracks best with the sperm-quality research.", "Weight is -0.45 kg vs. the 2026-06-27 baseline, 3.0 kg from the 76-78 kg target range — pace is steady but slower than the 0.4 kg/week goal; tightening portions on non-restaurant days would help most."]}